1
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:09,620
Father's Silver Jar

2
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:21,540
Long ago, there was a Cham farmer very hardworking.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,880
In old age, he saved a jar of silver.

4
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:42,800
However, he was very sad because his son was lazy.

5
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:51,340
One day, he told son:

6
00:00:53,170 --> 00:01:04,450
Father wants before closing eyes to see son earn rice bowl. Son go work and bring money here!

7
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:16,420
Mother afraid son hardship, gave him some money.

8
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:35,370
He took money to play a few days, when only few coins left brought back to father.

9
00:01:37,110 --> 00:01:44,400
Father immediately threw money into pond.

10
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:55,680
Seeing son still calm, father sternly said:

11
00:01:58,250 --> 00:02:04,940
This is not money son earned.

12
00:02:06,250 --> 00:02:08,820
Son went away again.

13
00:02:09,970 --> 00:02:18,450
Mother only dared give him a little food money.

14
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:33,850
When money ran out, he had to go to a village to pound rice for hire.

15
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:51,650
Pounding one basket of rice paid two bowls of rice, he only dared eat one bowl.

16
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:07,510
Throughout three months, saved ninety bowls of rice, he sold for money.

17
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:23,370
That day, old man was sitting warming by fire, son brought money back.

18
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:33,310
Old man immediately threw coins into fire.

19
00:03:35,540 --> 00:03:41,800
Son quickly reached hand into fire to take out.

20
00:03:44,570 --> 00:03:50,970
Old man laughed with tears:

21
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:58,680
Now father trusts that is money son earned.

22
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:09,140
Only by hard work does one know the value of money.

23
00:04:12,310 --> 00:04:15,480
Old man dug up silver jar and said:

24
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:28,020
If son is lazy, even if father gives one hundred silver jars it's not enough.

25
00:04:30,820 --> 00:04:39,480
Silver jar never runs out is son's pair of hands.

